win|PASS: Winning a match, gaining a prize and countable victory have distinct object and noun patterns; won/won and win-versus-beat guidance are accurate in all three examples.
content|REVIEW: [LEXICAL_IDENTITY] Information noun and satisfied adjective have distinct meanings and pronunciation stress; spelling alone cannot establish a shared Sense or existing Master identity.
fridge|PASS: Chilled storage appliance differs from freezer; remaining soup and cooling sequence translate faithfully and informal refrigerator shortening is accurate.
instrumental|REVIEW: [SENSE_BOUNDARY] Key-role and music-without-vocals adjectives are separate; the source-supported NOUN piece-of-music boundary remains unrepresented and requires coverage review.
nowadays|PASS: Present habitual online reservation contrasts with an earlier practice; the one-word form and current-period versus this-minute distinction are accurate.
